# The build context is this directory, and `.venv` alone is hundreds of
# megabytes of the wrong interpreter's packages. Nothing here is COPYied by the
# Dockerfile; excluding it keeps the context small and makes the image's
# contents exactly what the COPY lines name.
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
tests/
# Generated locally by ./gen-stubs.sh. The image generates its own, inside the
# build, from proto/ (ruling R22) -- a host copy must never leak in and shadow
# it, because it would have been built by a different grpcio-tools than the
# image's.
ext_mcp_pb2.py
ext_mcp_pb2_grpc.py
